{"pull": {"id": "number:21760", "number": 21760, "title": "KAFKA-20312: Handle null leader during OffsetFetcher regroup safely", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-03-15T03:40:21Z", "closed_at": "2026-04-27T12:11:20Z", "merged_at": "2026-04-27T12:11:20Z", "user": {"login": "nileshkumar3", "id": 12729879, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzI5ODc5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12729879?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3", "html_url": "https://github.com/nileshkumar3", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nileshkumar3/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Description:\n\nThis PR fixes a potential NullPointerException in\nOffsetFetcherUtils.regroupPartitionMapByNode when regrouping partitions\nby leader during offset reset / list-offsets.\n\nBackground\n\nPartitions are grouped by leader via metadata.fetch().leaderFor(tp). If\nmetadata changes between the initial leader lookup and the regroup step\n(e.g. leadership change or stale metadata), leaderFor(tp) can return\nnull. The previous implementation used Collectors.groupingBy(...,\nleaderFor(...)), which throws an NPE when the classifier returns null.\n\nFix\n\nOffsetFetcherUtils.regroupPartitionMapByNode  Replaced the stream-based\ngrouping with a loop that skips partitions whose leader is null, adds\nthem to a caller-provided partitionsToRetry set, and does not trigger\nmetadata refresh (callers are responsible for retry and metadata).\n\nCallers\n\nOffsetFetcher (classic consumer): passes partitionsToRetry into the\nhelper; in resetPositionsAsync, when the set is non-empty, calls\nsetNextAllowedRetry(partitionsToRetry, now + retryBackoffMs) and\nmetadata.requestUpdate(false).  OffsetsRequestManager (new consumer):\npasses a local retry set into the helper, then adds skipped partitions\nto state.remainingToSearch (with timestamp) and calls\nmetadata.requestUpdate(false) when the set is non-empty.  This keeps\nexisting retry semantics and avoids the NPE.\n\nTests\n\nOffsetFetcherTest.testResetPositionsMetadataRefreshWhenLeaderBecomesUnknownDuringRegroup\nSimulates leaderFor(tp) returning null during regroup (first\nmetadata.fetch() stubbed to a cluster with no partition, then real\nmethod). Asserts no exception, partition stays pending reset, and after\nbackoff and a second attempt with valid metadata the offset reset\nsucceeds.\n\nOffsetsRequestManagerTest.testFetchOffsetsRegroupSkipsNullLeaderPartition_NoNPE\nSimulates the same scenario in the fetch-offsets path: currentLeader has\na leader but metadata.fetch() returns a cluster where one partition has\nno leader. Asserts no NPE, one request sent (for the partition with a\nleader), and that the skipped partition is retried after metadata update\nand completes successfully.\n\nReviewers: TengYao Chi <frankvicky@apache.org>, Ken Huang <s7133700@gmail.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 820747028, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MjA3NDcwMjg=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/streams", "name": "streams", "color": "63edea", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 851033135, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4NTEwMzMxMzU=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/producer", "name": "producer", "color": "682dad", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 851033232, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4NTEwMzMyMzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/consumer", "name": "consumer", "color": "bf6a03", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 851034845, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4NTEwMzQ4NDU=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/tools", "name": "tools", "color": "fbca04", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 851037639, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4NTEwMzc2Mzk=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/connect", "name": "connect", "color": "0052cc", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 970614414, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw5NzA2MTQ0MTQ=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/performance", "name": "performance", "color": "c2e0c6", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 2650268685, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwyNjUwMjY4Njg1", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/kraft", "name": "kraft", "color": "FBCA04", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 4511886370, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABDO3sIg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/mirror-maker-2", "name": "mirror-maker-2", "color": "1282B2", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 5533745141, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABSdY_9Q", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/dependencies", "name": "dependencies", "color": "0366d6", "default": false, "description": "Pull requests that update a dependency file", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 5610263660, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABTmXUbA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/storage", "name": "storage", "color": "5319e7", "default": false, "description": "Pull requests that target the storage module", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 5624487963, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABTz7gGw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/tiered-storage", "name": "tiered-storage", "color": "B8FE9B", "default": false, "description": "Related to the Tiered Storage feature", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 6979675393, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABoAVlAQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/KIP-932", "name": "KIP-932", "color": "DA462F", "default": false, "description": "Queues for Kafka", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7388474305, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABuGMrwQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/build", "name": "build", "color": "d4c5f9", "default": false, "description": "Gradle build or GitHub Actions", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7489257233, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvmT_EQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/docker", "name": "docker", "color": "0db7ed", "default": false, "description": "Official Docker image", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7489266767, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvmUkTw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/generator", "name": "generator", "color": "3D836D", "default": false, "description": "RPC and Record code generator", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7489285940, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvmVvNA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/transactions", "name": "transactions", "color": "C71889", "default": false, "description": "Transactions and EOS", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": nul